97966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-04-15T08:15:40Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T08:47:51Z","closed_at":"2025-04-16T22:33:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105405","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105405","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105405.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105405.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Currently, property editors in the inspector reference a `_get_property_warning` method that can be overridden in the object. This method defines warnings for individual properties, but there is currently no documentation for this. The method currently works in the editor, the only thing this PR does is to document this function and to fix a bug where null return values would still print a warning error.\r\n\r\nIn the inspector currently:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e5ccaa79e2a2d5551369bd6cc1f8ed654a791275/editor/editor_inspector.cpp#L775-L778\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e5ccaa79e2a2d5551369bd6cc1f8ed654a791275/editor/editor_inspector.cpp#L1258-L1263\r\n\r\nThese warnings were added in #74644 with the intention of being used in the export popups. They do have the associated issue of not updating the yellow label until it is redrawn if the warning comes from the value of a different property. That being said; this is not an issue if the warning comes from the property itself, so the bug is minor and not in the scope of this PR.","closed_by":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105405/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105405/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}